        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Year Up showed no impact on employment at the six-year follow-up.",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "property": {
          "$bytes": "9b1f76ff9711404c861e59dc3fa7d037"
        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "The report says roughly 80% of both groups were working at the six-year survey and in Quarters 23–24. Higher earnings therefore should not be relabeled as a documented employment-rate gain.",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      },
